WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:04.700
Every time you click, scroll, buy, or search online — you are creating data.

2
00:00:05.067 --> 00:00:08.467
Your phone generates thousands of data points every single day.

3
00:00:08.767 --> 00:00:12.033
What apps you open. What you buy. Where you go.

4
00:00:12.433 --> 00:00:16.100
Companies collect all of this to understand how people actually behave.

5
00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:21.900
Which products do customers prefer? Where do users drop off? What content keeps people engaged?

6
00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:25.667
Data analysts are the professionals trained to find those answers.

7
00:00:25.967 --> 00:00:30.700
They build dashboards that turn complex data into clear, actionable insights.

8
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:36.133
The right insight at the right time can completely transform a business strategy overnight.

9
00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:41.700
Data skills are now among the most in-demand across banking, healthcare, and e-commerce.

10
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:46.867
Follow 0xverse Academy to start your data analytics journey today.

